sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Left
    participant B as Right
    Note left of A: Dotted
    A-->B: without arrow
    A-->>B: with arrowhead
    A<<-->>B: with bidirectional arrowheads
    A--xB: with a cross at the end
    A--)B: with an open arrow at the end (async)

    Note left of A: Solid
    A->B: without arrow
    A->>B: with arrowhead
    A<<->>B: with bidirectional arrowheads
    A-xB: with a cross at the end
    A-)B: with an open arrow at the end (async)

    Note left of A: Half-Arrows
    A-|\B: with top half arrowhead
    A-|/B: with bottom half arrowhead
    A/|-B: with reverse top half arrowhead
    A\|-B: with reverse bottom half arrowhead
    A-\\B: with top stick half arrowhead
    A-//B: with bottom stick half arrowhead
    A//-B: with reverse top stick half arrowhead
    A\\-B: with reverse bottom stick half arrowhead

    Note left of A: Connection dots
    A->>()B: with a dot at the receiver
    A()->>B: with a dot at the sender
    A()->>()B: with a dot at both ends
